---
pageKey: products
rootPath: "../"
sectionPath: "../"
---
{% set metaTitle = "製品・開発中ツール一覧｜開発と表現" %}
{% set metaDescription = "動画制作、配信連携、音声入力の製品と、制作・開発を支える仕組みを、対象者と現在の提供状況から確認できます。" %}
{% set canonicalPath = "/products/" %}
{% set metaCurrentTitle = "プロダクト" %}
{% set metaSchemaType = "CollectionPage" %}
{% set metaImage = "/images/assets/products/bai-video-production/bvp-home-routes-v611.png" %}
{% set metaImageAlt = "BAI VIDEO PRODUCTIONの開発中ホーム画面" %}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  {% include "partials/analytics-head.njk" %}
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
{% include "partials/meta.njk" %}
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/styles.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/subpages.css">
  <script src="../scripts/script.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  {% include "partials/analytics-body.njk" %}
  {% include "partials/header.njk" %}

  <main id="content" class="subpage-main product-hub2-page">
    <section class="product-hub2-hero" id="top" data-section><div class="product-hub2-shell"><nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="パンくず"><a href="../">HOME</a> / ツール</nav><h1>開発したツール</h1><p>映像編集、音声入力、ゲーム配信のために作ったソフトを紹介します。提供状況は各ツールに表示しています。</p></div></section>

    <nav class="product-hub2-nav reveal" aria-label="プロダクト一覧内メニュー">
      <div class="product-hub2-shell"><a href="#user-products"><span>利用者が使う製品</span><b>↓</b></a><a href="#creative-products"><span>制作用ツール</span><b>↓</b></a><a href="#foundation-products"><span>開発用ツール</span><b>↓</b></a><a href="#active-projects"><span>進行中の開発</span><b>↓</b></a></div>
    </nav>

    <section class="product-hub2-section" id="user-products" data-section>
      <div class="product-hub2-shell">
        <div class="product-hub2-heading reveal"><p class="connection-label cyan"><i></i>FOR CREATORS</p><h2>映像・配信・音声のツール</h2><p>各ツールの機能と画面を確認できます。</p></div>

        <article class="product-hub2-feature reveal">
          <div class="product-hub2-feature-copy">
            <p class="product-hub2-meta"><span class="is-building">発売準備中</span><b>Windows / Local-first</b></p>
            <h3>KOTOLVI<br><small class="product-hub2-name-ja">コトルヴィ</small></h3>
            <p class="product-hub2-lead">会話も、動画も、ことばからわかる。</p>
            <p>会話、動画字幕、画面内テキスト、OBS字幕、議事録を一つの翻訳ワークスペースへ。現在は機能統合中で、一般配布前です。</p>
            <dl><div><dt>対象</dt><dd>海外の会話・動画・配信を理解し、伝えたい人</dd></div><div><dt>開発状況</dt><dd>機能統合中 / Windows閉鎖試用前</dd></div></dl>
            <a class="product-hub2-link" href="https://baisound.github.io/BAI-Atlas-Live/">KOTOLVI製品サイトを見る <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
          <figure><picture><source srcset="../images/assets/products/kotolvi/kotolvi-talk.avif" type="image/avif"><source srcset="../images/assets/products/kotolvi/kotolvi-talk.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="../images/assets/products/kotolvi/kotolvi-talk.png" width="1920" height="1080" alt="英語と日本語の会話翻訳を表示するKOTOLVIの開発中画面" fetchpriority="high"></picture><figcaption>ACTUAL DEVELOPMENT UI / CURRENT CODENAME: BAI ATLAS</figcaption></figure>
        </article>

        <article class="product-hub2-feature reveal">
          <div class="product-hub2-feature-copy">
            <p class="product-hub2-meta"><span class="is-building">開発・検証中</span><b>Windows</b></p>
            <h3>BAI VIDEO<br>PRODUCTION</h3>
            <p class="product-hub2-lead">動画素材、字幕、音声を、一つの制作プロジェクトで仕上げる。</p>
            <p>複数のツールを行き来しながら動画を作っている、一人または少人数のクリエイター向け。現在は一般提供前です。</p>
            <dl><div><dt>対象</dt><dd>動画・ゲーム実況・配信を作る人</dd></div><div><dt>開発状況</dt><dd>Alpha / 実映像とWindows環境を検証中</dd></div></dl>
            <a class="product-hub2-link" href="bai-video-production/">機能と開発状況を見る <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
          <figure><picture><source srcset="../images/assets/products/bai-video-production/bvp-home-routes-v611.avif" type="image/avif"><source srcset="../images/assets/products/bai-video-production/bvp-home-routes-v611.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="../images/assets/products/bai-video-production/bvp-home-routes-v611.png" width="1676" height="590" alt="BAI VIDEO PRODUCTIONの開発中ホーム画面。三つの開始方法と最近のプロジェクトを表示" fetchpriority="high"></picture><figcaption>ACTUAL PRODUCT SCREEN / V6.1.1</figcaption></figure>
        </article>

        {% set userSlugs = ["make-tiktok-gift-master", "bai-voice-app"] %}
        <div class="product-hub2-list">
          {% for slug in userSlugs %}
          {% set item = productDetails[slug] %}
          {% set seoItem = productSeo[slug] %}
          <article class="product-hub2-row reveal">
            <figure class="product-hub2-thumb"><picture><source srcset="..{{ seoItem.imageBase }}.avif" type="image/avif"><source srcset="..{{ seoItem.imageBase }}.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="..{{ seoItem.image }}" width="1672" height="941" alt="{{ seoItem.imageAlt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture><figcaption>構成イメージ</figcaption></figure>
            <div class="product-hub2-code"><b>{{ item.status }}</b></div>
            <div class="product-hub2-row-main"><h3>{{ item.title }}</h3><p>{{ item.shortTitle }}</p></div>
            <dl><div><dt>対象</dt><dd>{{ item.audience }}</dd></div><div><dt>開発状況</dt><dd>{{ item.current[1].title }}</dd></div></dl>
            <a class="product-hub2-link" href="{{ slug }}/"><span>詳しく見る</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </article>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-hub2-section product-hub2-dark" id="creative-products" data-section>
      <div class="product-hub2-shell">
        <div class="product-hub2-heading reveal"><h2>映像・配信用の制作ツール</h2></div>
        {% set creativeSlugs = ["bai-creative-os", "bai-davinci-extends", "creator-streaming-tools"] %}
        <div class="product-hub2-list">
          {% for slug in creativeSlugs %}
          {% set item = productDetails[slug] %}
          {% set seoItem = productSeo[slug] %}
          <article class="product-hub2-row reveal">
            <figure class="product-hub2-thumb"><picture><source srcset="..{{ seoItem.imageBase }}.avif" type="image/avif"><source srcset="..{{ seoItem.imageBase }}.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="..{{ seoItem.image }}" width="1672" height="941" alt="{{ seoItem.imageAlt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture><figcaption>構成イメージ</figcaption></figure>
            <div class="product-hub2-code"><b>{{ item.status }}</b></div>
            <div class="product-hub2-row-main"><h3>{{ item.title }}</h3><p>{{ item.shortTitle }}</p></div>
            <dl><div><dt>対象</dt><dd>{{ item.audience }}</dd></div><div><dt>開発状況</dt><dd>{{ item.current[1].title }}</dd></div></dl>
            <a class="product-hub2-link" href="{{ slug }}/"><span>詳しく見る</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </article>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-hub2-section" id="foundation-products" data-section>
      <div class="product-hub2-shell">
        <div class="product-hub2-heading reveal"><h2>開発で使う自作ツール</h2><p>仕様、テスト結果、変更履歴を管理するために使っています。</p></div>
        {% set foundationSlugs = ["bai-development-os", "bai-knowledge-hub", "bai-development-hub"] %}
        <div class="product-hub2-list">
          {% for slug in foundationSlugs %}
          {% set item = productDetails[slug] %}
          {% set seoItem = productSeo[slug] %}
          <article class="product-hub2-row reveal">
            <figure class="product-hub2-thumb"><picture><source srcset="..{{ seoItem.imageBase }}.avif" type="image/avif"><source srcset="..{{ seoItem.imageBase }}.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="..{{ seoItem.image }}" width="1672" height="941" alt="{{ seoItem.imageAlt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture><figcaption>構成イメージ</figcaption></figure>
            <div class="product-hub2-code"><b>{{ item.status }}</b></div>
            <div class="product-hub2-row-main"><h3>{{ item.title }}</h3><p>{{ item.shortTitle }}</p></div>
            <dl><div><dt>役割</dt><dd>{{ item.summary }}</dd></div><div><dt>開発状況</dt><dd>{{ item.current[1].title }}</dd></div></dl>
            <a class="product-hub2-link" href="{{ slug }}/"><span>詳しく見る</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </article>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <aside class="product-hub2-codex-note reveal"><b>Codexの位置づけ</b><p>Codexは単独の製品ではなく、BAI DEVELOPMENT OSの規約と確認工程のもとで実装・検証を進める開発エージェントです。</p></aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-hub2-section product-hub2-active" id="active-projects" data-section>
      <div class="product-hub2-shell">
        <div class="product-hub2-heading reveal"><h2>進行中の個人開発</h2></div>
        <div class="product-hub2-active-grid">
          {% for project in currentProjects %}
          <article class="product-hub2-active-card tone-{{ project.tone }} reveal">
            <div><span>{% if loop.index < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ loop.index }}</span><b>{{ project.status }}</b></div>
            <small>{{ project.type }}</small><h3>{{ project.name }}</h3><p>{{ project.summary }}</p>
            {% if project.href %}<a href="{% if project.external %}{{ project.href }}{% else %}..{{ project.href }}{% endif %}"{% if project.external %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}>{{ project.linkLabel }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{% endif %}
          </article>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>



    <section class="product-hub2-section" id="connection"><div class="product-hub2-shell"><h2>開発と改善の流れ</h2><p>制作や配信でツールを使い、結果と不具合を記録します。再現手順をテストし、修正を次の版に反映します。</p></div></section><section class="product-hub2-final" data-section>
      <div class="product-hub2-shell reveal"><div><span>相談</span><h2>ツール開発のご相談</h2><p>自動化したい作業や、配信で使いたい機能をお知らせください。</p></div><a class="action action-white" data-cta-id="products-final-contact" href="../contact/#form"><span>開発を相談する</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    </section>
  </main>

  {% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
</body>
</html>
